"A boater, in Anesidoran slang, is a group of Avowed who keep each other in good jobs."
"Boater members recommend each other and keep job postings secret from outsiders."
"A boater relies on trust with the summoner who hires it."
"The LeafSong boater staffs the university's exams; most members are D-ranks, some C."
"Its members work as monitors, haulers, repairers, medics and housekeepers."
